+# Plan — the `show` option on the stats card
+
+## 1. Tests
+
+- [ ] 1.1 A stats card rendered with show reviews adds the reviews line and grows by one row (tests/renderStatsCard.test.js::`Test renderStatsCard > should show total reviews`) [AC-1]
+- [ ] 1.2 The endpoint passes `show` to the card as a list (tests/api.test.js::`Test /api/ > should pass the show option to the card`) [AC-2]
+
+## 2. The option
+
+- [ ] 2.1 Read `show` on `/api` with `parseArray` and pass it to the card (api/index.js)
+- [ ] 2.2 Show the reviews line when `show` holds `reviews`, and drop `show_total_reviews` (src/cards/stats-card.js, src/cards/types.d.ts)
+- [ ] 2.3 Document `show` in place of `show_total_reviews` (readme.md)
